{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\SecretSanta\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "implements-consumable",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/Draw.php:24 OCA\\SecretSanta\\Db\\Draw extends OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\SnowflakeAwareEntity",
        "lib/Db/Participant.php:30 OCA\\SecretSanta\\Db\\Participant extends OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\SnowflakeAwareEntity",
        "lib/Db/SecretSantaList.php:36 OCA\\SecretSanta\\Db\\SecretSantaList extends OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\SnowflakeAwareEntity"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 classes implement or extend what the public API marks #[Consumable] in a major of Nextcloud 35 to 36: an app calls it, and the server may add a method to it in any release, which breaks a class that implements it.",
        "  lib/Db/Draw.php:24 OCA\\SecretSanta\\Db\\Draw extends OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\SnowflakeAwareEntity",
        "  lib/Db/Participant.php:30 OCA\\SecretSanta\\Db\\Participant extends OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\SnowflakeAwareEntity",
        "  lib/Db/SecretSantaList.php:36 OCA\\SecretSanta\\Db\\SecretSantaList extends OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\SnowflakeAwareEntity"
      ]
    }
